sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Complainant
    participant UI as PHP Form
    participant S as Security Helpers
    participant DB as MariaDB
    participant N as Notification Service
    participant M as Email Adapter
    participant A as Audit Log
    C->>UI: Submit complaint + attachment
    UI->>S: Validate CSRF and fields
    S-->>UI: Validation result
    UI->>S: Validate MIME and store file
    S-->>UI: Secure stored filename
    UI->>DB: Insert complaint with SLA due date
    DB-->>UI: New complaint ID
    UI->>S: Generate GRV reference number
    S->>DB: Update reference number
    UI->>DB: Insert timeline event
    UI->>N: Notify administrators
    N->>DB: Store in-app notifications
    UI->>M: Queue/log email notifications
    M->>DB: Store email delivery status
    UI->>A: Record create event
    A->>DB: Store audit log
    UI-->>C: Show reference number and receipt link
